  "title": "Bodacious Brownies",
  "description": "My kids love them, they all ways want me to make them. I drizzle them with melted chocolate and vanilla-flavored candy coating. Delicious!",
  "authors": [
    "Elizabeth"
  ],
  "date_published": "1998-04-29T19:21:07-04:00",
